# Text files are stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, committing from Windows warns "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# on every file, and the same commit produces genuinely different working
# copies on Windows and on Linux or macOS — which turns a contributor's
# editor into a source of whole-file diffs.
#
# Every text file already in the repository is LF in the index, so this
# normalizes nothing retroactively; it only fixes what happens on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never convert line endings, never diff as text.
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ico  binary
